# Keep build context small AND keep secrets OUT of images.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Secrets / local-only — must never land in an image layer
.env
.env.*
cred.txt
*.cred
/config
*.kubeconfig
**/.surirun*

# Dev/test noise
docs
**/*.md
!apps/web/index.html
.github
.vscode
.idea
coverage
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
